{"version":1,"content":"<p>致力於讓 Linux 系統在蘋果 M 晶片上運行的 Asahi Linux 項目日前宣佈：開始把旗下代碼倉庫轉向 GPL 2.0 或更高版本的許可證。從 MIT 許可證轉向 GPL 許可證意味着寬鬆授權被收緊，作為開源項目為什麼要收緊許可條款呢？</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585682.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.172116+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:28:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"5607e407fed4ffd2fbaee1337d2b0c7e8e5d7d61ed1737c0099547f43a906917","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}